{"name":"Ketchup","hex":"#9a382d","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"ketchup","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Ellipsis of tomato ketchup (“a tomato-vinegar-based sauce, sometimes containing spices, onion or garlic, and (especially in the US) sweeteners”).","Such a sauce more generally (not necessarily based on tomatoes, but with mushrooms, fish, etc.). This is the older meaning."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To cover with ketchup.","↑ \"Ketchup\", Oxford English Dictionary (online edition, 2020)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/ketchup"}],"entries":[{"title":"Ketchup","blocks":[{"text":"Ketchup or catsup is a table condiment with a sweet and sour flavor."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f3/Ketchup_20160918_181342_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Ketchup_20160918_181342_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ketchup","wikidata":"Q178143"},{"title":"Ketchup (Adventure Time)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Ketchup\" is the name of the eleventh episode of the ninth season of the American animated television series Adventure Time. The episode was written and storyboarded by Seo Kim and Somvilay Xayaphone, from a story by lead writer Kent Osborne, Jack Pendarvis, Julia Pott, Patrick McHale, Ashly Burch, and series showrunner Adam Muto. It originally aired on Cartoon Network on July 18, 2017 and guest stars J. G. Quintel as a blue jay."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/3/30/Adventure_Time_Ketchup_Title_Card.png/330px-Adventure_Time_Ketchup_Title_Card.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ketchup_(Adventure_Time)","wikidata":"Q56275970"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/90/Mushroom_ketchup_%28homemade%29_-_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Mushroom_ketchup_%28homemade%29_-_%28cropped%29.jpg?u